{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isopod</strong> is a roly poly platforming adventure from the wonderful world of <strong>Webbed</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expressive Physics Platforming!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/cef9e77a94d09684b0dbf652498dce8a.poster.avif?t=1759026993\" width=600 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/cef9e77a94d09684b0dbf652498dce8a.webm?t=1759026993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/cef9e77a94d09684b0dbf652498dce8a.mp4?t=1759026993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll up and smash your way through the undergrowth as a bouncy little wrecking ball! The <strong>Fire Ant Conglomerate </strong>won't know what hit 'em!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Magnet Drive!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/2684b48c38852023effbb13f2299714c.poster.avif?t=1759026993\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/2684b48c38852023effbb13f2299714c.webm?t=1759026993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/2684b48c38852023effbb13f2299714c.mp4?t=1759026993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>cool ant</strong> strapped a magnet to your back! Use it to swing through the air, catch flying cannonballs, and zip down powerlines... or just remove heavy metals from the soil - that's an isopod's job after all. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Isopod Skins!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/7804a87f578bdff8480a69ed121c6ebd.poster.avif?t=1759026993\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/7804a87f578bdff8480a69ed121c6ebd.webm?t=1759026993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/7804a87f578bdff8480a69ed121c6ebd.mp4?t=1759026993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find trinkets and trade them for unique shells, both real and fantastical!\u00a0<strong>Be the isopod that you want to be!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2053910?t=1759026993","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759026993","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759026993","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759026993","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isopod</strong> is a roly poly platforming adventure from the wonderful world of <strong>Webbed</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expressive Physics Platforming!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/cef9e77a94d09684b0dbf652498dce8a.poster.avif?t=1759026993\" width=600 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/cef9e77a94d09684b0dbf652498dce8a.webm?t=1759026993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/cef9e77a94d09684b0dbf652498dce8a.mp4?t=1759026993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll up and smash your way through the undergrowth as a bouncy little wrecking ball! The <strong>Fire Ant Conglomerate </strong>won't know what hit 'em!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Magnet Drive!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/2684b48c38852023effbb13f2299714c.poster.avif?t=1759026993\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/2684b48c38852023effbb13f2299714c.webm?t=1759026993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/2684b48c38852023effbb13f2299714c.mp4?t=1759026993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>cool ant</strong> strapped a magnet to your back! Use it to swing through the air, catch flying cannonballs, and zip down powerlines... or just remove heavy metals from the soil - that's an isopod's job after all. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Isopod Skins!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/7804a87f578bdff8480a69ed121c6ebd.poster.avif?t=1759026993\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/7804a87f578bdff8480a69ed12